            <div class="summary-icon-box">
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3135/3135715.png" alt="Housewarming Avatar">
            </div>
            <div>
                <h2 class="summary-title">Grahapravesam</h2>
                <p class="summary-desc">Financial support for housewarming celebrations. A small gift from SDWA for your new beginning and the memories you'll build in your new home.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-grid">
