              <img src="_content/SPIC.MauiBlazorApp.Shared/Images/Svg/Build.svg"  />

            <h3 class="title-right">About the Scheme</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="content-text">
            The Grahapravesam Welfare Scheme is designed to support registered SDWA dealers who have recently completed the construction or purchase of a new home. SDWA recognises that a housewarming is a significant life milestone and provides a one-time financial assistance to help celebrate this occasion with family and friends. The benefit aims to ease the financial burden associated with new home rituals and celebrations.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="welfare-card">
        <div class="section-header">
                        <img src="_content/SPIC.MauiBlazorApp.Shared/Images/Svg/Build.svg"  /> Eligibility Criteria
        </div>
        <ul class="custom-list">
            <li>Must be a registered and active SDWA Dealer</li>
            <li>Minimum quantity lifted as per current threshold</li>
            <li>Valid beneficiary relationship document</li>
            <li>Membership active for minimum required duration</li>
            <li>No pending welfare application for same scheme</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

