 Frequently Asked Questions
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-header">
                Who can apply for Grahapravesam? 
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-header">
                Who can apply for Grahapravesam? <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-muted"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-body">
                Any registered and active SDWA dealer who has completed a housewarming ceremony within the last 3 months is eligible to apply, provided they meet the minimum quantity lifted criteria.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-header">
                When should I submit the application? <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-muted"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-body">
                Applications must be submitted within 3 months of the housewarming event date. Applications submitted after this window will not be accepted.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-header">
                Can I re-upload documents after submission? <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-muted"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-body">
                Yes. If the MO reviewer requests additional or revised documents, you will be notified and can re-upload within the portal. You cannot re-upload after final SDWA approval.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-header">
                How do I track my application status? <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-muted"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-body">
                After submission, you will receive an Application ID. Visit My Applications in the portal to track real-time approval status and receive SMS/email notifications at each stage.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

